:: StoryTitle
Sugar Test

:: StoryData
{"ifid": "Y", "format": "SugarCube", "format-version": "2.36.1", "start": "Begin"}

:: StoryInit
<<set $hp to 10>><<set $name to "Ann">>

:: Begin [tag]
Hello $name, you have <<print $hp>> hp.
<<if $hp gt 5>>You feel strong.<<elseif $hp gt 0>>You feel weak.<<else>>You are dead.<</if>>
[[Fight|Fight][$hp -= 4]]
<<link "Rest" "Begin">><<set $hp to $hp + 1>><</link>>
<<if $hp lte 3>>[[Run away->End]]<</if>>
<<timed 5s>><<goto "End">><</timed>>

:: Fight
You fight. HP: $hp.
<<if $hp lte 0>><<goto "End">><</if>>
[[Again->Fight][$hp -= 4]]
[[Stop|Begin]]
<<back "Retreat">>

:: End
The end.
